results.ground_truth:
Without loss of generality, let the triangle sides have length 6.

[asy]
pair A = (1, sqrt(3)), B = (0, 0), C= (2, 0);
pair M = (1, 0);
pair D = (2/3, 0), E = (4/3, 0);
draw(A--B--C--cycle);
